<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Vincent | Personal Space</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
    "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    background: #f8f8f6;
    color: #252525;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
}

header {
    height: 76px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0 8%;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #eaeaea;
    background: rgba(248,248,246,0.95);
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 10;
}

.logo {
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #666;
}

nav a:hover {
    color: #9a795b;
}

.hero {
    min-height: 570px;
    padding: 120px 10% 100px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #efeee9;
}

.eyebrow {
    color: #99836b;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 76px);
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.hero h1 span {
    color: #a58b70;
}

.hero p {
    max-width: 520px;
    color: #777;
    font-size: 16px;
}

.hero-links {
    margin-top: 35px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 15px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.btn {
    padding: 11px 25px;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    font-size: 13px;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.btn:hover {
    background: #333;
    color: white;
}

section {
    padding: 90px 10%;
}

.section-title {
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
}

.section-subtitle {
    color: #999;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 50px;
    align-items: center;
}

.about-text p {
    color: #777;
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.about-card {
    background: #eeece6;
    min-height: 260px;
    padding: 40px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
}

.about-card h3 {
    font-size: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.about-card p {
    color: #888;
    font-size: 14px;
}

.grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    padding: 30px;
    border: 1px solid #eeeeec;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
}

.card-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #a58b70;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.card h3 {
    font-size: 19px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.card p {
    color: #888;
    font-size: 14px;
}

.notes {
    background: #efeee9;
}

.note-item {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #deddd8;
}

.note-item span {
    color: #999;
    font-size: 13px;
}

.contact {
    text-align: center;
    background: #292b2c;
    color: white;
}

.contact p {
    color: #aaa;
    margin: 15px 0 30px;
}

.contact a {
    color: #d0b89d;
}

footer {
    padding: 25px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #999;
    font-size: 12px;
    background: #292b2c;
    border-top: 1px solid #444;
}

@media (max-width: 650px) {
    header {
        padding: 0 5%;
        height: 65px;
    }

    nav {
        gap: 12px;
        font-size: 12px;
    }

    .logo {
        font-size: 19px;
    }

    .hero {
        min-height: 490px;
        padding: 90px 7%;
    }

    section {
        padding: 65px 7%;
    }

    .about {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 25px;
    }

    .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .note-item {
        gap: 15px;
    }
}

@media (max-width: 380px) {
    nav {
        gap: 8px;
        font-size: 11px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">VINCENT.</div>
    <nav>
        <a href="#home">首页</a>
        <a href="#about">关于</a>
        <a href="#blog">博客</a>
        <a href="#projects">作品</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<main>

<section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO MY WORLD</div>

    <h1>
        Stay curious.<br>
        <span>Keep exploring.</span>
    </h1>

    <p>
        你好，我是 Vincent。<br>
        一个保持好奇、热爱生活，也在不断探索世界的年轻人。
        这里记录我的思考、学习、创造与成长。
    </p>

    <div class="hero-links">
        <a href="#about" class="btn">认识我 →</a>
        <a href="#projects" class="btn">探索我的作品</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
    <div class="section-title">About Me.</div>
    <div class="section-subtitle">关于我 · ABOUT</div>

    <div class="about">
        <div class="about-text">
            <p>
                我是一名正在探索计算机世界的大学生，
                对技术、文学、设计和生活保持着浓厚的兴趣。
            </p>

            <p>
                我相信学习不应该只是为了考试，
                更应该是认识世界、理解世界和创造价值的过程。
            </p>

            <p>
                希望在这里留下那些值得记录的瞬间，
                也希望未来回望时，能够看见自己成长的轨迹。
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-card">
            <h3>关于生活</h3>
            <p>
                阅读 · 思考 · 编程 · 旅行 · 摄影<br><br>
                保持热爱，保持独立思考。<br>
                慢慢来，但不要停止探索。
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="blog">
    <div class="section-title">My Journal.</div>
    <div class="section-subtitle">文字与思考 · JOURNAL</div>

    <div class="grid">
        <article class="card">
            <div class="card-label">READING</div>
            <h3>关于阅读与生活</h3>
            <p>
                在文字中寻找共鸣，在阅读中重新认识生活。
            </p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
            <div class="card-label">THINKING</div>
            <h3>关于成长与思考</h3>
            <p>
                保持好奇，独
